# Grave Bramble, a 3/4 green Plant with defender, cast with Black Lotus mana (exactly {1}{G}{G}), its characteristics as printed,
# and "protection from Zombies" (CR 702.16e): the damage that Bot2's Dregscape Zombie (a Zombie, 2/1) would deal to it in combat
# on turn 4 is prevented, so the Bramble is undamaged while it kills the Zombie. On turn 6 a Grizzly Bears (the control, not a
# Zombie) attacks and the Bramble blocks it: its 2 damage is dealt and marked.

